m_experiments_to_priors.html\">From Experiments to Priors: Eliciting Informative Priors for Your Marketing Mix Model</a> <span class=\"index-date\">February 2026</span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rule-card\">\n    <h3>2025</h3>\n    <ul class=\"rule-list\">\n      <li><a href=\"articles/bayesian_models_and_risk_optimization/bayesian_models_and_risk_optimization.html\">Bayesian Models and Risk Optimization</a> <span class=\"index-date\">August 2025</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"articles/nomore_experiments_without_causality/nomore_experiments_without_causality.html\">Media Mix Model calibration is useless without causal knowledge</a> <span class=\"index-date\">April 2025</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"articles/baby_steps_for_causal_discovery/baby_steps_for_causal_discovery.html\">Baby Steps for Causal Discovery</a> <span class=\"index-date\">February 2025</span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>"},{"en_text":"<section class=\"articles-strip\" aria-labelledby=\"articles-connect\">\n  <div>\n    <h2 id=\"articles-connect\">Want the short version?</h2>\n    <p>Talks cover the same ground out loud, and the diary is where the work in progress lives.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"articles-strip-links\">\n    <a href=\"talks.html\">Talks &amp; presentations <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n    <a href=\"diary.html\">Diary <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n    <a href=\"mailto:carlos.trujillo.agostini@gmail.com\">Email me <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n  </div>\n</section>"},{"en_text":"<section id=\"article-network\" class=\"network\" data-network data-network-source=\"articles-network.json\" aria-labelledby=\"articles-heading\" aria-describedby=\"network-instructions\">\n  <header class=\"network-header\" data-network-header>\n    <div class=\"network-header-row\">\n      <h1 class=\"hero-name\" id=\"articles-heading\">Articles<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></h1>\n      <div class=\"network-toolbar\">\n        <div class=\"n